1
00:00:03,169 --> 00:00:05,438
Everything ready?

2
00:00:05,438 --> 00:00:07,107
Wow... you look beautiful

3
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:16,049
What the?

4
00:00:16,416 --> 00:00:18,651
What the hell is this?

5
00:00:18,651 --> 00:00:19,786
Who sent it?

6
00:00:19,786 --> 00:00:21,621
Does that really matter?

7
00:00:25,158 --> 00:00:27,093
Ma'am, this is all a misunderstanding

8
00:00:27,093 --> 00:00:28,661
Please, let me explain

9
00:00:28,661 --> 00:00:30,597
Save it for your lawyer

10
00:00:30,597 --> 00:00:32,599
Ma'am...

11
00:00:32,766 --> 00:00:35,001
Don't call me that

12
00:00:35,001 --> 00:00:36,236
This wedding is off

13
00:01:04,664 --> 00:01:09,704
[Mobile Wedding Invitation Link] Heesu, I'm sorry...
I don't have a choice but to get married

14
00:01:09,704 --> 00:01:16,414
You know I love you, right? I'll stop by soon Oh,
and I might need a little more time to pay you back~

15
00:01:16,976 --> 00:01:19,179
Married?

16
00:01:20,713 --> 00:01:23,083
Love?

17
00:01:25,418 --> 00:01:28,755
You fucking bastard, Kim Tae Oh...

18
00:01:41,234 --> 00:01:43,970
Looking for someone to help ruin a wedding

19
00:01:43,970 --> 00:01:45,405
Reward: 5 million won

20
00:01:45,405 --> 00:01:48,341
Any legal consequences
are solely the poster's responsibility

21
00:02:02,355 --> 00:02:04,424
Can we meet right now?

22
00:02:04,424 --> 00:02:06,926
Let's meet at Penguin Cafe in an hour

23
00:02:33,153 --> 00:02:36,189
Kwon Heesu? Is that really you?

24
00:02:37,524 --> 00:02:38,892
Long time no see

25
00:02:38,892 --> 00:02:41,961
Lee Kangjun...? What are you doing here?

26
00:02:41,961 --> 00:02:45,298
Did you come to talk me out of going after Tae Oh?

27
00:02:45,298 --> 00:02:48,034
"Looking for someone to help ruin a wedding"

28
00:02:48,034 --> 00:02:50,136
I saw your post

29
00:02:50,136 --> 00:02:53,139
Sit down. I want to help too

30
00:02:54,073 --> 00:02:55,742
Why would you?

31
00:02:55,742 --> 00:02:58,144
You're his friend

32
00:02:58,811 --> 00:03:00,246
Friend?

33
00:03:00,246 --> 00:03:01,948
Maybe before that asshole stole

34
00:03:01,948 --> 00:03:04,951
tens of billions from me and disappeared

35
00:03:10,323 --> 00:03:13,293
Kim Tae Oh, that bastard...

36
00:03:13,293 --> 00:03:16,262
He ran off with everything I had

37
00:03:16,262 --> 00:03:18,064
He talked me into starting a business with him

38
00:03:18,064 --> 00:03:19,666
and even got me to take out loans

39
00:03:19,666 --> 00:03:22,502
Then he poured that money
into his fiancée's family,

40
00:03:22,502 --> 00:03:25,238
and reinvented himself to marry into them

41
00:03:25,238 --> 00:03:27,240
What?

42
00:03:27,574 --> 00:03:29,609
While you were dating him for three years,

43
00:03:29,609 --> 00:03:32,979
he'd already been planning this marriage
for the last year

44
00:03:33,513 --> 00:03:35,949
His fiancée's family
owns a pretty big distribution company

45
00:03:35,949 --> 00:03:37,750
Honestly, I feel bad for them too

46
00:03:37,750 --> 00:03:41,621
They're basically handing their daughter
over to a con artist

47
00:03:41,621 --> 00:03:43,957
You really think causing a scene
at the wedding is enough revenge?

48
00:03:43,957 --> 00:03:46,793
That asshole isn't the type to get dumped over

49
00:03:46,793 --> 00:03:49,162
losing some money or cheating

50
00:03:49,162 --> 00:03:51,864
He'll just put on a sad face and beg his way out of it

51
00:03:51,864 --> 00:03:54,400
Then what am I supposed to do?

52
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,736
I'm gonna do everything I can

53
00:03:56,736 --> 00:04:00,206
Because there's no way in hell
I'm letting him get his happy ending

54
00:04:00,707 --> 00:04:02,342
We're gonna bury him properly

55
00:04:02,342 --> 00:04:04,944
Legally, socially...

56
00:04:04,944 --> 00:04:08,948
and with his precious future in-laws spitting in his face

57
00:04:08,948 --> 00:04:11,985
The money he locked up as "wedding funds"?

58
00:04:11,985 --> 00:04:13,786
I'm getting every last cent back

59
00:04:14,354 --> 00:04:16,055
So what's your plan?

60
00:04:18,291 --> 00:04:20,226
First things first, let's go to my place

61
00:04:20,660 --> 00:04:22,795
You and I are partners now

62
00:04:22,795 --> 00:04:24,797
Deal?

63
00:04:26,799 --> 00:04:29,068
Seriously though, what were you thinking posting that?

64
00:04:29,068 --> 00:04:31,938
Who puts the wedding venue and time in the post?

65
00:04:31,938 --> 00:04:33,306
Are you an idiot?

66
00:04:33,306 --> 00:04:35,308
Turns out I am

67
00:04:52,759 --> 00:04:54,193
Why are you just standing there?

68
00:04:54,193 --> 00:04:56,129
Come in and sit down

69
00:05:07,507 --> 00:05:09,175
This is wild

70
00:05:09,175 --> 00:05:11,911
Tae Oh wouldn't shut up about you

71
00:05:11,911 --> 00:05:15,181
being an assistant manager at some big company

72
00:05:15,581 --> 00:05:19,018
Meanwhile, that bastard told his fiancée's family

73
00:05:19,018 --> 00:05:22,955
that he was some self-made entrepreneur

74
00:05:24,324 --> 00:05:26,859
The money you sent him for living expenses,

75
00:05:26,859 --> 00:05:28,761
and every penny from my loans...

76
00:05:28,761 --> 00:05:32,031
he used it all to build that fake success story

77
00:05:32,031 --> 00:05:35,668
Her parents genuinely think he's this hardworking guy

78
00:05:35,668 --> 00:05:38,204
That's why they approved the marriage

79
00:05:38,204 --> 00:05:40,206
That fucking psycho...

80
00:05:40,406 --> 00:05:42,375
You know what's even crazier?

81
00:05:42,375 --> 00:05:44,010
And get this

82
00:05:44,010 --> 00:05:47,747
her family is paying for the entire wedding

83
00:05:47,747 --> 00:05:49,148
All Tae Oh has to do is show up,

84
00:05:49,148 --> 00:05:51,951
marry into the family,
and get his hands on the company

85
00:05:51,951 --> 00:05:54,987
It's a disgusting plan

86
00:05:59,559 --> 00:06:02,695
Stay here for a while

87
00:06:02,695 --> 00:06:05,998
Until we've completely ruined that bastard,

88
00:06:05,998 --> 00:06:08,668
we need to work on this together

89
00:06:08,668 --> 00:06:10,970
Stay with you?

90
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:11,938
Why?

91
00:06:11,938 --> 00:06:13,840
What, you think I'm gonna jump you or something?

92
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:18,478
Hey, I got screwed over too.
My life's a mess right now

93
00:06:18,478 --> 00:06:22,248
Let's just think of ourselves
as partners until we get our revenge

94
00:06:30,123 --> 00:06:31,457
For now, go take a shower

95
00:06:31,457 --> 00:06:35,061
You smell like a guy
who's been rotting away for days

96
00:06:35,061 --> 00:06:36,829
You wanna die?

97
00:06:36,829 --> 00:06:38,464
There are towels in the bathroom,

98
00:06:38,464 --> 00:06:41,200
and I'll leave some clothes out
for you in front of the door

99
00:07:02,989 --> 00:07:07,927
Heesu, I'm sorry... I don't have a choice
but to get married You know I love you, right?

100
00:07:10,163 --> 00:07:13,332
...Get it together

101
00:07:26,446 --> 00:07:28,781
Want a drink?

102
00:07:36,756 --> 00:07:39,192
Look at that... here we are again

103
00:07:39,192 --> 00:07:42,328
Man, I'm sick of seeing your face

104
00:07:42,328 --> 00:07:46,332
You were always hanging around Tae Oh

105
00:07:46,833 --> 00:07:48,734
What are you talking about...

106
00:07:49,402 --> 00:07:51,871
You don't remember?

107
00:07:52,171 --> 00:07:57,643
That time I had a date with Tae Oh

108
00:07:57,643 --> 00:07:59,946
then said he was bringing you along?

109
00:07:59,946 --> 00:08:02,748
I just went with it,

110
00:08:02,748 --> 00:08:06,018
but the idiot overslept and never showed up

111
00:08:06,652 --> 00:08:10,490
So you and I ended up
watching a movie by ourselves

112
00:08:16,162 --> 00:08:18,164
Thanks

113
00:08:20,066 --> 00:08:22,068
For what?

114
00:08:37,850 --> 00:08:42,288
Mmm... Tae Oh... five more minutes...

115
00:09:06,879 --> 00:09:08,180
Holy shit...

116
00:09:08,205 --> 00:09:11,005
"My Ex's Wedding"
